## Fully Implemented Features

### Gap #7: Interactive Layer Control ✅

**All layers now respect visibility toggles:**
- ✅ **Modules** (`if show_modules:`)
- ✅ **Shadows** (`if show_shadows:`)  
- ✅ **Racking** (`if show_racking:`)
- ✅ **eBOS** (`if show_ebos:`)
- ✅ **Environment** (`if show_env:`)

**How It Works:**
```python
# Each 3D trace wrapped in conditional
if show_modules:
    fig.add_trace(go.Mesh3d(...))  # Only renders if enabled
```

**User Experience:**
- Toggle any checkbox to instantly show/hide
- Clean decluttered views
- Focus on specific design elements

